{"title":"Aggregation of mixed unverifiable and not-holds lines in a range is untested","severity":"P2","file":"review-triage/tools/lineorigin/lineorigin.go","line":126,"confidence":75,"autofix_class":"gated_auto","owner":"downstream-resolver","requires_verification":false,"pre_existing":false,"suggested_fix":"Add a test (on classify) with a range holding an unverifiable line and a not-holds line in both orders, expecting not-holds, plus a holds+unverifiable range expecting unverifiable.","first_evidence":"lineorigin.go:126-131 -- switch { case l.kind == notHolds: res.kind = notHolds; case l.kind == unverifiable && res.kind == holds: res.kind = unverifiable }"}
