{"title":"git failures other than bad input are reported as exit 2 input errors with misleading text","severity":"P2","file":"review-triage/tools/lineorigin/lineorigin.go","line":220,"confidence":75,"autofix_class":"gated_auto","owner":"downstream-resolver","requires_verification":true,"pre_existing":false,"suggested_fix":"In gitRunner.run return a typed error for the non-ExitError (git cannot start) branch; in toplevel/commit translate to the input-error message only when git ran and exited non-zero (and include trimmed stderr), otherwise propagate the original error. Exit with a distinct code for non-input failures and document it. Add a test with PATH lacking git.","first_evidence":"review-triage/tools/lineorigin/lineorigin.go:220 -- return \"\", fmt.Errorf(\"-root が git のリポジトリの中を指していません: %s\", dir)"},
{"title":"Inherited GIT_DIR / GIT_INDEX_FILE etc. override -C and select the wrong repository","severity":"P3","file":"review-triage/tools/lineorigin/lineorigin.go","line":232,"confidence":50,"autofix_class":"gated_auto","owner":"downstream-resolver","requires_verification":true,"pre_existing":false,"suggested_fix":"Filter GIT_DIR, GIT_WORK_TREE, GIT_INDEX_FILE, GIT_COMMON_DIR, GIT_OBJECT_DIRECTORY, GIT_ALTERNATE_OBJECT_DIRECTORIES, GIT_NAMESPACE, GIT_PREFIX out of os.Environ() before appending GIT_LITERAL_PATHSPECS/GIT_OPTIONAL_LOCKS."},
{"title":"exists() treats every git failure as path not present","severity":"P3","file":"review-triage/tools/lineorigin/lineorigin.go","line":270,"confidence":50,"autofix_class":"advisory","owner":"downstream-resolver","requires_verification":false,"pre_existing":false,"suggested_fix":"Use git ls-tree -z --name-only <commit> -- <file> and make exists return (bool, error)."},
{"title":"git subprocesses run without a timeout or context","severity":"P3","file":"review-triage/tools/lineorigin/lineorigin.go","line":231,"confidence":50,"autofix_class":"gated_auto","owner":"downstream-resolver","requires_verification":true,"pre_existing":false,"suggested_fix":"Use exec.CommandContext with a timeout, GIT_TERMINAL_PROMPT=0, and a distinct timeout error rather than exit 2."}
],"residual_risks":["Minimum git version likely understated (rev-parse --end-of-options).","Parsing untested under LANG/LC_ALL or CRLF content.","writeResult ignores stdout write errors.","Shallow clones: unreachable -base reported as exit 2 input error."],"testing_gaps":["No test for git missing from PATH.","No test distinguishing non-input git failures from bad input.","No test with inherited GIT_DIR/GIT_WORK_TREE/GIT_INDEX_FILE.","No timeout test."]},
